--[[
        THE LISTENER -- a new one: blind, like Figure, it hears your steps

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/Listener"))()

        A tall, gaunt thing of red flesh, its ribcage glowing, comes in through the door of your room and walks it, its
        throat clicking, stopping now and then to listen with its head cocked. Its every move is animated (a walk with
        its knees and long arms swinging, its stance foot on the floor, its head turning toward what it hears, twitching).
        It cannot see you: it hears you. Walk near it and it hears your steps (crouched, it does not); heard too much, it
        roars and charges with its arms out, faster than you run. Caught: your death. Hide while it charges and it walks
        to your hiding place, sniffs it, and goes back to wandering. After a minute it leaves the way it came.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes). Outside DOORS it comes in front of you.
]]

